        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't burst digivolve or DNA digivolve.",
        "question": "Can I use this card's ＜Delay＞ effect to burst digivolve or DNA digivolve into a card in my hand?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't.  This card's ＜Delay＞ effect digivolves 1 Digimon. It doesn't digivolve Tamers.",
